# Theme and CMS media are versioned locally so runtime rendering does not depend
# on an external asset host.

# Item models are the exception: they are generated from the game client by
# tools/model-pipeline and belong to a deploy, not to the source. The full
# catalogue is 831 MB across nearly eleven thousand files, and git would carry
# that in every clone forever. Build them on the deploy host, or copy the
# folder across; a site without them falls back to the 2D icons.
apps/web/public/models/
